From: rinth-client <335801235+rinth-client@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 21:19:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] network: Queue packets their handlers only hand off without
 the round trip


diff --git a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/network/Connection.java b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/network/Connection.java
index 06b946fd2827c003d426c9e6c828b1734ce03a88..e847ad53239b55a0bb3ff029761667fe168e2939 100644
--- a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/network/Connection.java
+++ b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/network/Connection.java
@@ -152,4 +152,10 @@
                 try {
+                    // Rinth start: a packet its handler only hands to the game's thread is queued without the round trip (ADR 0033)
+                    if (!rinth.client.net.PacketHandoff.handOff(packet, packetListener))
+                    // Rinth end
                     genericsFtw(packet, packetListener);
                 } catch (RunningOnDifferentThreadException var5) {
+                    // Rinth start
+                    rinth.client.net.PacketHandoff.handedOff(packet, packetListener);
+                    // Rinth end
                 } catch (RejectedExecutionException ignored) {
